{"version":1,"content":"<p>比利時、瑞典、愛爾蘭及盧森堡數十間超市周一（2日）疑遭網絡攻擊，導致店內的雪櫃及冷凍櫃故障，大量食物變壞。</p><p>這已是歐洲近期第二度發生同類網攻事故，法國數百間超市上月亦曾中招。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:21:21.742395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:22.191568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:18:18.544127+00:00","content_hash":"7420ac4494e18fd004485953487db7ece8ad2a115e779fa6f3863691819b2ec2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}